<title>IRAQ: Iraqi pilgrim plane lands in Saudi Arabia - INA.</title>
<headline>Iraqi pilgrim plane lands in Saudi Arabia - INA.</headline>
<dateline>BAGHDAD 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>An Iraqi plane flying Moslem pilgrims to the haj pilgrimage in defiance of a United Nations air embargo on Baghdad landed on Wednesday in Saudi Arabia, the official Iraqi News Agency said.</p>
<p>&quot;The Iraqi News Agency has learned that the Iraqi plane carrying Iraqi pilgrims to Mecca has already landed in Jeddah airport,&quot; the agency said. No further details were immediately available.</p>
</text>
